# Sources are LF, in the repository and in the working tree. This machine has
# core.autocrlf=true, which without this rule rewrites every checked-out file to
# CRLF -- and check_format.py then fails the whole file with a diff that looks
# like a total rewrite, because it reads the file keeping \r\n but takes
# clang-format's stdout translated to \n. The repository already stores LF, so
# this only pins what a fresh clone lands with.
#
# third_party/imgui is a submodule and carries its own attributes; nothing here
# reaches into it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary
